        "text": "Its food is large quantities of dark star kelps, which grow in great amounts in broken star lake. Star Mark, Starlight, and Star Shoot are the three Immortal Gu left in the blessed land after Star Lord Wan Xiang’s fourth Immortal Gu was destroyed in his fight with Song Zi Xing.",
