  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Star Form blessed land, beside Star Mark and starlight Immortal Gu, Star Form land spirit names the third Immortal Gu Star Shoot.",
        "chapters": [
          852
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_star_form_blessed_land",
          "gu_starlight_immortal_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan already uses the mortal killer move spring star rain, which spends large numbers of Star Shoot Gu each time, and those mortal Gu were sold only by Star Lord Wan Xiang. With star shoot Immortal Gu, he can use spring star rain freely, raise it to an immortal killer move with this Gu as the core, and further raise the yield of Star Fragment Grass.",
        "chapters": [
          852
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "spring-star-rain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_star_shoot_gu",
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
          "gu_star_fragment_grass"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Star Form land spirit states that Star Lord Wan Xiang already held the immortal killer move spring star rain. The mortal version he sold was a simplified copy, and the mortal star shoot Gu he sold were refined by using star shoot Immortal Gu, which is why reverse deduction of that recipe was hard.",
        "chapters": [
          852
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "spring-star-rain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After he gains the star path inheritance and star shoot Immortal Gu, spring star rain becomes an immortal killer move whose effect is dozens of times better than before.",
        "chapters": [
          902
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "immortal-spring-star-rain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s transactions with Sixth Hair, Eat Strength, Cleanse Soul, Fixed Immortal Travel, Star Shoot, Star Mark, and Starlight are said to have self-detonated through Fang Yuan’s special will, with Ying Wu Xie unable to save them, though that information could be false.",
        "chapters": [
          1079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "special-will-loss",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_sixth_hair",
          "move_eat_strength",
          "gu_cleanse_soul",
          "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
          "char_ying_wu_xie"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
